-first century ; All down in black and white","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Appendixes. A, Fellow travelers ; B, Scriptures to keep you company ; C, Timelines of major world religions ; D, The names of God.","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}}],"links":[{"url":"http://www.loc.gov/catdir/enhancements/fy1114/2010915379-b.html","title":"Contributor biographical information"},{"url":"http://www.loc.gov/catdir/enhancements/fy1114/2010915379-d.html","title":"Publisher description"}],"lc_classifications":["BL80.3 .T67 2011"],"contributions":["Buckles, Luke"],"edition_name":"4th ed.","contributors":[{"role":"Contributor","name":"name"}],"source_records":["marc:marc_loc_updates/v39.i34.records.utf8:14136524:2815","marc:marc_loc_2016/BooksAll.2016.part38.utf8:143296259:2815","ia:completeidiotsgu0000toro_b0l7","promise:bwb_daily_pallets_2022-04-01","marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/ab.bib.12.20150123.full.mrc:756661762:2616","marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/20220215_036.bib.mrc:210943228:3180"],"title":"The complete idiot's guide to world religions","languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"subjects":["Religions"],"publish_country":"nyu","by_statement":"by Brandon Toropov and Luke Buckles","oclc_numbers":["701051110"],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"other_titles":["Complete idiot's guide","World religions"],"publishers":["Alpha"],"description":"Presents an overview of the world's major religions, and answers questions about the history, rituals, celebrations, structure, holy documents, and deities of major and lesser-known religions.","full_title":"The complete idiot's guide to world religions","key":"/books/OL25003949M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL33729A","name":"Brandon Toropov"}],"publish_places":["New York, N.Y"],"pagination":"xviii, 413 p. :","classifications":{},"lccn":["2010915379"],"notes":"\"A revealing comparison of the faiths that shape the lives of millions\"--Cover.\r\n\r\nIncludes bibliographical ref