lete Idiot's Guide to World Religions, Third Edition, points out the differences--and similarities --of spiritual worship around the world. In this newly updated and revised Complete Idiot's Guide, you get information on:\r\nHow each major religion views such controversial issues as war and peace, euthanasia, suicide, and abortion.\r\nRituals and holidays as celebrated through Christianity, Judaism, Islam, Hinduism, Buddhism, and other spiritual beliefs.\r\nSacred texts written in such books as the Bible, Torah, Qur'an, Bhagavad Gita, and other doctrines.\r\nReligious extremism in the post-9/11 world--and the responses of the major religious scriptures to those who pursue terror and hate in the name of God.\r\n--back cover"},"local_id":["urn:bwbsku:174-ABB-486"],"source_records":["promise:bwb_daily_pallets_2020-03-26","bwb:9781592572229","marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/ab.bib.09.20150123.full.mrc:420456241:872"],"latest_revision":6,"revision":6,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2021-07-15T20:57:42.220930"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2024-12-06T18:28:28.995857"}}},"ISBN:9781101097809":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9781101097809","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL24252121M/The_Complete_Idiot's_Guide_to_World_Religions","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL24252121M/The_Complete_Idiot's_Guide_to_World_Religions","thumbnail_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/6399782-S.jpg","details":{"publishers":["Penguin USA, Inc."],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"source_records":["marc_overdrive/InternetArchiveCrMarc-2010-06-11e.mrc:453020:2460"],"title":"The Complete Idiot's Guide to World Religions","identifiers":{"overdrive":["BA3AA302-301D-43F6-BEA3-36834847435F"]},"isbn_13":["9781101082959","9781101097809","9781101094839"],"covers":[6399782],"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2010-06-17T01:26:32.609231"},"physical_format":"Electronic resource","last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2