covers":[12496630],"copyright_date":"2002","publish_places":["Indianapolis, IN"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"description":"You're no idiot, of course. You're familiar with all the holidays and four or five Of the \"major\" religions, but the many peoples of the world have a colorful and diverse history—and many ways of recognizing a higher power or spiritual presence. You could spend eternity exploring them all!\r\n\r\nYou don't have to give up your possessions or make pil- grimages around the globe to comprehend other belief systems! The Complete Idiot's Guide€ to World Religions, Second Edition, increases your awareness by teaching you the doctrines of others' spiritual beliefs. In this newly updated and revised Complete Idiot's Guide', you learn: The fundamentals of Judaism, Christianity, Islam, Hinduism, and Buddhism.\r\n\r\nThe origins of Asian religions including Taoism,\r\nConfucianism, and Shinto.\r\nThe beliefs of ancient faiths of the Egyptians,\r\nDruids, Aztecs, and Incas.\r\nThe traditions of nonscriptural nature religions\r\nfrom Africa, North America, and island cultures.","edition_name":"Second Edition (4)","ocaid":"completeidiotsgu0000toro_a7o2","isbn_10":["0028642082"],"isbn_13":["9780028642086"],"lccn":["2001093549"],"oclc_numbers":["937314465"],"lc_classifications":["BL74"],"source_records":["bwb:9780028642086"],"latest_revision":6,"revision":6,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2021-12-25T15:30:50.610165"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2022-11-17T15:17:22.320919"}}},"ISBN:9780375728457":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9780375728457","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL7427087M/The_Universe_in_a_Single_Atom","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL7427087M/The_Universe_in_a_Single_Atom","thumbnail_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/229800-S.jpg","details":{"publishers":["Random House Large Print"],"identifiers":{"goodreads":["1163231"],"amazon":[""]},"subtitle":"The Convergence of S